### 2️⃣ CREATE USER (ADMIN ONLY)
### ===============================
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "email": "user1@mail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "user"
}


